<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to prohibit in New South Wales uranium
mining and certain nuclear facilities; and for other
purposes.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="part" id="pt.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_60362f5e-23b1-4eb8-8af9-443929dbedf3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 1</b></no><heading guid="_d3b3d7a0-bab6-4720-b6ee-96d798fcefb6"
id="pt.1-he"><b>Preliminary</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_20902df0-c4fd-489c-b90d-f53026a96e99"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_59b7926c-7a27-4425-a0ae-a80dc9224ef7"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref type="act"
jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1986-194"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Uranium Mining and Nuclear Facilities (Prohibitions) Act
1986</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_324270b7-0228-48fb-8a45-eead3d1e7ef6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_545d1442-3971-489b-a1a9-98f5edf415b4"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f5ca9758-2364-40f3-849a-f9d913939844"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Sections 1 and 2 shall commence on the date of
assent to this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_64b0bfd7-7b1f-42eb-9a33-cb9394a4bf76"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Except as provided by subsection (1), this Act
shall commence on such day as may be appointed by the Governor and notified by
proclamation published in the Gazette.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e915a4c1-6d64-4e50-8392-a5b566191da1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_036780b6-60ae-4d2b-87bc-1e4e391f8124"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Objects of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The objects of this Act are&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_47ab079a-65e3-47fb-99ac-b22ff483f22c" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to prohibit mining for uranium,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d9a8fa27-1f53-4194-9a78-21b7d7e8db02" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to prohibit the construction or operation of
nuclear reactors and other facilities in the nuclear fuel
cycle,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">in order to protect the health, safety and welfare of
the people of New South Wales and the environment in which they
live.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 2012 No 16,
Sch 3 [1].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_54a75227-671b-4a28-b7be-762b89c76291"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_8d044eca-3f57-4c06-b423-789720ef6679"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, except in so far as the context or
subject-matter otherwise indicates or requires&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_dd9a525f-7bc9-4b80-a090-c717925e7a8a"
id="sec.4-def.enrichment"><b><i>enrichment</i></b></defterm>, in relation to
nuclear material, means any process by which the proportion of an isotope is
increased in relation to the natural abundance of the isotope.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_dc5ce248-21fc-41fe-9230-b5e544947e96"
id="sec.4-def.mine"><b><i>mine</i></b></defterm>, in relation to uranium,
includes to produce uranium ore concentrates in a mill or other
plant.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5b33ec5c-50dd-410e-8bb0-59a8dc83db59"
id="sec.4-def.nuclearfacility"><b><i>nuclear facility</i></b></defterm> means
a nuclear facility within the meaning of section 8.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ae898611-45b5-4551-aa01-cb1f10d65509"
id="sec.4-def.nuclearfuelcycle"><b><i>nuclear fuel cycle</i></b></defterm>
includes any process or step in the utilisation of material capable of
undergoing nuclear fission, including its ultimate disposal.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_2c6e8956-6648-45b3-80f5-7c24ecd82c40"
id="sec.4-def.nuclearmaterial"><b><i>nuclear material</i></b></defterm> means
any radioactive substance associated with the nuclear fuel cycle, including
radioactive waste material.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_d25ff13c-b947-4294-a6f1-aa8532190fbe"
id="sec.4-def.nuclearreactor"><b><i>nuclear reactor</i></b></defterm> means a
device designed to produce controlled nuclear fission.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_05f20f92-25cc-4a27-a3bf-12516298ec8c"
id="sec.4-def.regulation"><b><i>regulation</i></b></defterm> means a
regulation made under this Act.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 2012 No 16,
Sch 3 [2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3a02addf-134d-4015-af03-845e49affa06"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_5deae089-1050-4543-a227-bb553ffb34ba"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Act to bind Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown, not only in right of
New South Wales but also, so far as the legislative power of Parliament
permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eb3078a8-83f6-48fd-ab2d-93707b9e631d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_ffa8f9e4-7f85-4ec6-9b8c-1a21f0336122"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Act to prevail over other Acts and laws</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dba018ad-17e8-46b6-9c12-c158f3d085bc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act has effect notwithstanding any other Act
or law to the contrary.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12af120f-96ba-49b1-93ae-a4d7f774042d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act affects the operation
of&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fc00a9a3-94b1-425d-bde2-9fa0d3050f73" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1990-013"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Protection from
Harmful Radiation Act 1990</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c9b76797-9ec1-4ad5-89de-13c86e13d09a" id="sec.6-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-2011-010"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Work Health and
Safety Act 2011</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 2000 No 93,
Sch 2.59; 2011 No 67, Sch 4.30; 2023 No 30, Sch 2.7[1].</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_465f64a5-25dc-4f2b-b302-ea6eeb9e6aab"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_074ecddf-6f00-44fc-ba71-ea60059d488b"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Prohibition of uranium mining and certain nuclear
facilities</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0106f562-01b4-42bc-806f-929442c3fb04"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_04e134bd-8b11-4781-8a8e-c52c3656a667"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Mining for uranium prohibited</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2b731fc3-3fbb-4764-98aa-0a0f91bf3da4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person shall not mine for
uranium.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.7-ssec.1-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1474eedc-b644-4d34-8fbb-7c836d704286"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty&#8212;1,000 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3a9ef7dd-cc1e-4bca-a56c-4a639bc7ec5e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An authority, mineral claim or opal prospecting
licence under the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-1992-029"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Mining Act
1992</i></name></legref> (whether granted before or after the commencement of
this subsection) does not authorise the holder of the authority, claim or
licence to mine for uranium in contravention of this
section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1b46657b-745a-4c45-a971-11f46c6f6037"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person who mines uranium in the course of
mining for some other mineral is not guilty of an offence under this section
if&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_db5c0062-ca43-42c0-b104-25d78a3e5317" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person establishes that there are reasonable
grounds for believing that the amount of uranium in the total amount of
material that has at that stage been removed from the land being mined does
not exceed .02 per cent by weight, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b6ba620f-636f-476e-905c-31a5b760e90c" id="sec.7-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person complies with such conditions (if any)
as may be prescribed by the regulations with respect to the mining and the
treatment, handling and disposal of the material containing
uranium.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_15c55909-bde5-489a-99ac-722dff5db1da"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this section prevents a person from
using radiometric or other means for searching for a mineral other than
uranium.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Am 1993 No 47,
Sch 1; 2012 No 16, Sch 3 [3] [4].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5603f03a-cf5f-43ca-baa2-8b23a974ab10"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_c6a9f781-ccb7-4b17-94ae-280ec21ee58e"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Constructing or operating certain nuclear facilities
prohibited</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d582356e-9518-494b-9774-e282c24658cf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6b7a04f2-3a1d-439b-8543-8f702e0608b8"
id="sec.8-ssec.1-def.nuclearfacility"><b><i>nuclear
facility</i></b></defterm> means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ff7e8dd1-a4f9-49bf-8cd3-5b28dab9e4ef" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a facility for the conversion of uranium ore into
uranium hexafluoride or any other chemical in order to enable its
enrichment,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b6ca4a56-a8cf-43f1-9539-0c2e1a1deb31" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an isotope separation plant or other facility for
the enrichment of nuclear material,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c704fd6e-ddd5-4de4-a604-c0f3b3d1f632" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a fabrication plant or other facility for
transforming nuclear material into a form suitable for use as fuel in a
nuclear reactor,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a38dd8e7-fef8-466f-a07f-e663240ce5ea" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a nuclear reactor, whether or not designed for
the purpose of generating electricity,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_965a70ce-defd-4fbc-9250-c12a2747355f" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a reprocessing plant or other facility for the
chemical separation of fuel that has been irradiated in a nuclear reactor,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_21e6ad8c-b5eb-4367-9b61-3ed622ac711a" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a separate storage installation for the storage
or disposal of any nuclear material (including radioactive waste material) in
the nuclear fuel cycle, being nuclear material used in or resulting from any
of the facilities described in paragraphs
(a)&#8211;(e).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5dad662d-6a8d-4bf6-ab2b-0140c20b96e1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person shall not construct or operate a nuclear
facility.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.8-ssec.2-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f7d9e2be-110c-4681-a758-cefa1988fd1c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty&#8212;1,000 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_44333a23-d41f-4f96-8e99-2a17acef656e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this section prevents&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4afc860c-00c8-48f1-9866-a14b81013505" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the construction or operation, under an Act of
the Commonwealth, of a nuclear facility by the Australian Atomic Energy
Commission or by any authority of the Commonwealth that replaces that
Commission,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6d0cd6a5-f547-4fe5-88c8-c2b03badf281" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the construction or operation of a facility for
the storage or disposal of any radioactive waste material resulting from the
use of nuclear materials for research or medical purposes or for any other
purpose authorised under the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Radioactive Substances Act
1957</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7b540172-94fc-4878-b39b-c092c557edde" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the operation of a nuclear powered
vessel.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 8:</b> Am 1993 No 47,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9efd4b44-3e4f-4af9-b857-05a485ba9b2d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_cdceb666-dcca-433f-8105-e843caeeada1"
id="sec.9-he"><b>State authorities not to construct or operate nuclear
reactors to generate electricity</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without affecting the generality of this Act,
nothing in any other Act authorises an authority of the State (including an
electricity generator within the meaning of the <legref type="act"
jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1995-095"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Energy Services Corporations Act 1995</i></name></legref>)
to construct or operate, or to approve or permit the construction or operation
of, a nuclear reactor for the purpose of generating electricity or any other
form of energy.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 9:</b> Am 1995 No 18,
Sch 5. Subst 1995 No 95, Sch 4.</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_54ff5eb2-6541-43fb-ab0c-dea056933358"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_70837d4d-0f86-4b5b-b054-58ab19dc006c"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Enforcement</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f1cd1017-21ec-4220-aa34-296790a875b4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_1245264b-59e9-4a23-80c7-1cc287acc535"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Restraint etc of breaches of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1f7333f3-6c84-47f3-bedf-9274cf12f794"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any person may bring proceedings in the Land and
Environment Court for an order to remedy or restrain a breach of this Act,
whether or not any right of that person has been or may be infringed by or as
a consequence of that breach.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0b85dbd5-a0b5-45d0-83c7-680ea3654216"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Proceedings under this section may be brought by
a person&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fa661460-f8d3-48fa-81a8-1c2783127f36" id="sec.10-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on the person&#8217;s own behalf,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1f8f1abf-4ba6-490f-99b6-df5956baf498" id="sec.10-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on behalf of the person and on behalf
of&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2c0d7e01-8689-498c-974d-948eab18a51e"
id="sec.10-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">other persons (with their consent),
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d6e1dc1e-9184-46f2-b4d3-13110bc41e5a"
id="sec.10-ssec.2-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a body corporate or unincorporated (with the
consent of its committee or other controlling or governing
body),</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">having like or common interests in those
proceedings.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_72ca4aad-f57e-47aa-bff5-df694822df46"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any person on whose behalf proceedings are
brought is entitled to contribute to or provide for the payment of the legal
costs and expenses incurred by the person bringing the
proceedings.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_260aaa52-d3b7-46cf-bb2f-9f9f65568d1f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the Land and Environment Court is satisfied
that a breach of this Act has been committed or that a breach of this Act
will, unless restrained by order of that Court, be committed, it may make such
order as it thinks fit to remedy or restrain the breach.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_45f2cac0-81fb-4909-81c6-5e9c4f83848d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The powers and functions of the Land and
Environment Court under this section are in addition to and not in derogation
from any other powers and functions of that Court.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d9f5a8bb-1565-4a97-9b81-73b7f318d64a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section, a reference to a breach of this
Act is a reference to&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_62eb92de-bb21-4483-8ea4-eeca1b0837c1" id="sec.10-ssec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a contravention, whether by act or omission, of
this Act or the regulations, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7dce4674-efe5-401f-aca4-881721c16f85" id="sec.10-ssec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a threatened or an apprehended contravention,
whether by act or omission, of this Act or the
regulations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8642b140-d122-41a8-9517-a996e5c09855"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_681bff70-3664-4ef1-ac20-209b87546024"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Offences by corporations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_641254aa-eeb7-4b09-a67e-f3f7a517e4b5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If a corporation contravenes, whether by act or
omission, any provision of this Act or a regulation, each person who is a
director of the corporation or who is concerned in the management of the
corporation shall be deemed to have contravened the same provision if the
person knowingly authorised or permitted the
contravention.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_56777305-23d6-41ff-8ec4-165ade3efa77"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person may be proceeded against and convicted
under a provision pursuant to subsection (1) whether or not the corporation
has been proceeded against or been convicted under that
provision.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2588706f-2107-4ca9-a984-c8c20d5522a2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this section affects any liability
imposed on a corporation for an offence committed by the corporation against
this Act or the regulations.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_196c1961-1bfc-4e6e-ac5f-2c843e951985"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_12b9c85f-c2e7-4df6-a946-74bddeaa9e43"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Proceedings for offences</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Proceedings for an offence against this Act or
the regulations may be taken only before the Land and Environment Court in its
summary jurisdiction.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8843a392-14ba-40e5-ac54-ebe24ff9e62d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 4</b></no><heading guid="_5f5205e5-8424-4aab-86f1-2f480bb0ed0a"
id="pt.4-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dad05ef1-2f23-4644-bc6c-bee5c85267fd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_8ae6d3d6-c4f3-4f5b-bd9a-603bd43cfdb9"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_271bd66b-ebce-46df-b61e-a308b1b16064"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d88fd349-6bc7-4ad8-850b-340f515de271"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A regulation may create an offence punishable by
a penalty not exceeding 20 penalty units.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1eece69d-d085-4ace-8e14-9c5000c1aacd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A provision of a regulation may&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2e2d8952-240f-41ab-ae69-9c5d312002df" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">apply generally or be limited in its application
by reference to specified exceptions or factors,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0c4dcf47-3e9b-45cd-89ee-4502c0de9596" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">apply differently according to different factors
of a specified kind, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7cdd0600-fd12-4464-93fe-118f52f08d08" id="sec.13-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">authorise any matter or thing to be from time to
time determined, applied or regulated by any specified person or
body,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">or may do any combination of those
things.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 13:</b> Am 1993 No 47,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14" status="repealed">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3d8baee6-c725-43cc-bebd-0f104d3b4938"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib>
<attrib name="status" value="repealed"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14, 15</no></head>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>


